---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section id="journey" class="py-16 md:py-20">
  <div class="section-wrap">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">Start Your Voter Journey</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Choose your next step.</h2>
    <p class="section-deck">Check registration, find your ballot, review candidates, and understand what's at stake before Election Day.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <a class="glass-panel block min-h-44 p-4 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/70" href="https://myinfo.alabamavotes.gov/VoterView" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><p class="text-2xl">🪪</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold">Check Registration</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/65">Verify status, polling place, and registration details.</p></a>
      <a class="glass-panel block min-h-44 p-4 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/70" href={`${base}counties`}><p class="text-2xl">🗳️</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold">Find My Sample Ballot</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/65">Select your county and get official SOS ballot links.</p></a>
      <a class="glass-panel block min-h-44 p-4 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/70" href={`${base}candidates`}><p class="text-2xl">⚖️</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold">See Who's Running</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/65">Browse all 2026 primary candidates by race and party.</p></a>
      <a class="glass-panel block min-h-44 p-4 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/70" href={`${base}amendments`}><p class="text-2xl">📜</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold">Review Amendments</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/65">Plain-language explainers for the two statewide amendments.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
